          "quote": "“有细菌生长”不等于已经发生感染"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 requires correcting patient/family misconceptions. The doctor explicitly corrected the caregiver's fear that 'positive culture = infection' and 'need to self-medicate', explaining the concepts of colonization versus infection and the necessity of clinical correlation. This went beyond simply stating drug names, addressing the specific misunderstanding.",
